{"id": "EUVD-2026-93313", "enisaUuid": "336846f6-b9d3-3f5e-9797-00c720bad87d", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: add HE 6 GHz capability in the scan elems len\n\nThe HE 6 GHz Band Capability element is in the probe request for\nevery band if 6 GHz is supported, so add the size to scan_ies_len.\n\nOtherwise, building probe request elements can fail, triggering the\nWARN_ON in __ieee80211_start_scan().", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:46:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:17:38", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/db19d5414227d86cee77a000607a6710d7f36853", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/be7bfdea1ec9b672a80c736bd6ed932e1adebef8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8659bd6c4c852096b6621086d1ea38eed84b454a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad5bd0f6a0c337a80c141ea8e6c7a1d9c145be79", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d83c08dcce808c732988a5291e3ef4f59d09edb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd54bf333f5631d3630bab0a832e9ae648f73515"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hvjp-xxq4-q29j", "CVE-2026-98328"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "13080c87-07f4-3f73-878e-8c84c1f8863a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2ad2274c58ee2dcaf9ccde5c63ff30f59b138f77 <be7bfdea1ec9b672a80c736bd6ed932e1adebef8"}, {"id": "3e0d1558-3dbc-3617-b600-f62deaa34c15", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "75b9c946-32e2-3ac5-9da9-69e3fb52079e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.8"}, {"id": "789d647c-15c5-35ba-aad3-d1a2bf979a1c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "7bb9f6d7-536b-3e0e-8f90-dcffa23548ed", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "7c4fb84c-51e2-31ed-b5ad-cb5da074831d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vend